<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/contentIdentifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A canonical, unique, immutable identifier of the artifact content, that may be\nused for verifying its identity and/or integrity."@en .
